Package: voicenux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Felitendo <felitendoyt@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@, pipewire, wireplumber
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Homepage: https://github.com/voicenux/voicenux
Description: voice changer for Linux
 Change your voice in real time in Discord, games, OBS and any other app.
 Voicenux adds the Voicenux Microphone to PipeWire: apps that pick it hear
 your changed voice.
 .
 It comes with 69 voices, from Baby and Robot to Demon and Underwater, AI
 voices for NVIDIA and AMD graphics cards, background sounds, a soundboard
 that finds sounds on MyInstants, and Voicelab to build your own voices from
 26 effects. Global shortcuts, a tray icon and a command line control it.
